Wi-Fi station configuration

Usage:
  tickerbox wifi [command]

Available Commands:
  scan        Scan for nearby Wi-Fi networks
  set         Update Wi-Fi station settings
  settings    Show Wi-Fi station settings
  status      Show current Wi-Fi station status

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for wifi

Global Flags:
  -d, --device string      named device from the config file
      --host string        TickerBox base URL ($TICKERBOX_HOST, or the default device; error if neither is set)
  -j, --json               emit raw device JSON instead of a decoded table
      --retry int          retry an idempotent request this many times on a transient failure (default 2)
      --timeout duration   per-request timeout (default 10s)

Use "tickerbox wifi [command] --help" for more information about a command.
